{
  "name": "Unified Invoice Archiving - Generic Template",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Unified Invoice Archiving — Generic Template\n\n**Gmail → PDF extraction → Validation → SFTP → Google Sheets**\n\nFour configurable example providers (A–D). No real vendor information or personal credentials are included.\n\n## Setup\n1. Configure the four profiles in **Configure Providers**: sender, regex patterns, SFTP folder.\n2. Connect Gmail OAuth2, SFTP and Google Sheets credentials.\n3. Set the Gmail search query, spreadsheet ID and four worksheet names.\n4. Create columns: `uniqueKey`, `Provider`, `Invoice Number`, `Date`, `Amount`, `Currency`, `Service`, `File`.\n5. Run manual tests with actual text-based invoices and confirm all output fields.\n6. Enable the six-hour schedule only after successful testing.\n\n**Limitations:** No OCR or AI, no exactly-once SFTP deduplication, no automatic error notifications. Emails are retained. Parsing patterns are examples and require adaptation.",
        "height": 1000,
        "width": 636,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "46e1ffc5-aea7-4e34-9c5d-ef228a214990",
      "name": "00 — WORKFLOW OVERVIEW",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        -512
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 01 — Triggers\nManual or scheduled every six hours. Keep inactive until configured.",
        "height": 578,
        "width": 362,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "50e5294b-75cd-42df-b1d9-68c27dd3aefb",
      "name": "01 — TRIGGERS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1552,
        -128
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 02 — Gmail intake\nFetch PDF attachments, filter by type and split multiple PDFs into independent items. Configure Gmail search and OAuth2.",
        "height": 578,
        "width": 904,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "a926d6ba-2026-4d58-ac75-89687686cebb",
      "name": "02 — GMAIL INTAKE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1936,
        -128
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 03 — Configure, extract & validate\n**Configure Providers** defines four example providers. Extract PDF text, identify the sender and parse invoice number, date, total and optional service. Edit regex patterns for your own invoice formats.",
        "height": 578,
        "width": 800,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "fc954940-c150-411d-b3db-0366be3f6305",
      "name": "03 — EXTRACT & VALIDATE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2832,
        -128
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 04 — Storage & completion\nFour branches: **Filter → SFTP → Restore → Google Sheets upsert → Completed**. Configure paths, credentials and sheets. Email is retained. Reprocessing may upload the same PDF again.",
        "height": 1088,
        "width": 1200,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "524d0142-afdd-468f-8894-926c781d7d7d",
      "name": "04 — STORAGE & COMPLETION",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3600,
        -336
      ]
    },
    {
